# CareerGuide Backend API Documentation

## Base URL

http://localhost:8080

---

## 1. Save Student Profile

### Endpoint

POST /api/students/profile

### Content-Type

application/json

### Request Body

{
  "fullName": "Test Student",
  "age": 19,
  "college": "Test College",
  "course": "BTech Computer Science and Engineering",
  "semester": "3rd Semester"
}

### Response

{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    ...
  }
}

---

## 2. Evaluate Career Recommendations

### Endpoint

POST /api/recommendations/evaluate

### Content-Type

application/json

### Request Body

{
  "profile": {
    "fullName": "Test Student"
  },
  "skills": [
    "Java",
    "Problem Solving"
  ],
  "interests": [
    "Software Development",
    "Web Development"
  ],
  "answers": {
    "1": "yes",
    "2": "yes"
  }
}

### Response

{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    ...
  ]
}

---

